  "descriptionPlain": "Reporting to the Director, Customer Success, the Senior Customer Success Manager is responsible for managing and providing world-class partnerships to their clients and ensuring they are optimizing the use and value of PointClickCare’s solutions. The ideal Senior Customer Success Manager will possess business consulting background and enterprise knowledge that enables them to drive an engagement at the C-level. This position can work remotely and will travel to various client locations as required. \nMinimum Qualifications  \nYou are passionate about the future of work, and committed to working with teammates to meaningfully impact acute and long-term post-acute care markets that provide care for vulnerable populations. \n\n\n",
  "description": "<div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reporting to the Director, Customer Success, the Senior Customer Success Manager is responsible for managing and providing world-class partnerships to their clients and ensuring they are optimizing the use and value of PointClickCare’s solutions. The ideal Senior Customer Success Manager will possess business consulting background and enterprise knowledge that enables them to drive an engagement at the C-level. This position can work remotely and will travel to various client locations as required.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Minimum Qualifications&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You are passionate about the future of work, and committed to working with teammates to meaningfully impact acute and long-term post-acute care markets that provide care for vulnerable populations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience in a customer-facing role within a Saas/tech company</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience in a Healthcare Sales/Account Management/Customer Success Management role with emphasis in managing a book of business, primarily focused on Enterprise customers.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven track record of sustaining and growing relationships</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Preferred Qualifications&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Owns and delivers joint customer success plan, to help build, grow, and expand client relationships at all levels while driving business alignment on desired outcomes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Act as a Trusted Advisor and Business Partner, providing strategic guidance and a “path to value” to customer Executive Leadership and internal account teams, demonstrating cross functional collaboration.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Leverage PointClickCare customer success methodology that provides a prescriptive relationship management experience, anticipating customer challenges and meeting them with solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide early warning and turnaround strategies that focus on customer health and churn mitigation.  Act as a point of escalation, when required, help manage customer expectations, and develop save plans for at-risk accounts.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Exceptional relationship builder that is accustomed to taking initiative in fast-paced environments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong written and oral communication and presentation skills, plus the ability to work independently in remote environment to deliver customer success.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven proficiency in data analysis including interpreting and translating results.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field or equivalent practical experience and experience using a CRM tool (Salesforce and/or Gainsight)</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
