ng initiative in fast-paced environments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong written and oral communication and presentation skills, plus the ability to work independently in remote environment to deliver customer success.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-listid=\"2\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-leveltext=\"\" aria-setsize=\"-1\">\n<p><span xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven proficiency in data analysis including interpreting and translating results.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777